      "title": "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a Linear System With Variables Other Than x, y, z"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "4ded1cd8-ad48-5c77-84c3-d74bc3ecbc85",
      ":question/problem": "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}9p-7q &=1 \\\\ 9p-7q &=-8\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order $p,q$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient.\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}9 & -7 \\\\ 9 & -7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}9 & -7 & 1 \\\\ 9 & -7 & -8\\end{array}\\right]\n$$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "716d4233-0824-5d0d-8abe-f5ca11c67b7e",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "2d69f9f7-a80e-5845-b959-24bb0c6f0a13",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -7 & 9 \\\\ -8 & -7 & 9\\end{array}\\right]"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "9707820c-6bd3-58d5-8a4d-3f04ecdf3ef0",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}9 & -7 & 1 \\\\ 9 & -7 & -8\\end{array}\\right]"
            },
